==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Quests|
{{BotW Quest
 |name= Curry for What Ails You
 |type= Side Quest
 |giver= [[Lester]]
 |location= [[Rito Stable]]
}}
}}
Goron Spice can be purchased from the [[Goron Gusto Shop]] in [[Goron City]]. Alternatively, it is sold by the [[Traveling Merchant]] [[Yammo]] near the [[Tabantha Great Bridge]]. It is made of several different spices, and the initial wave of spiciness turns into sweetness.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> While it cannot be eaten, it can be used to make certain [[Food]]s at a [[Cooking Pot]]. At the [[Kochi Dye Shop]], Goron Spice is one of the ingredients that can be used to make Red [[Dye]].

As part of the "[[Curry for What Ails You]]" [[Side Quest]], [[Link]] must give a bottle of Goron Spice to [[Lester]] at the [[Rito Stable]] so he can make [[Curry Rice]].<ref name="BotW Lester"/> Upon obtaining Goron Spice, Lester will ask Link to trade it for 50 [[Rupee]]s.<ref name="BotW Lester 2"/> Afterwards, Link can trade Goron Spice with him at any time for [[Hylian Rice]].<ref name="BotW Lester 3"/>

