== Trivia ==
* The label on Goron Spice contains [[Hylian (Language)|Hylian]] writing that translates to "Spice".<ref name="BotW NA"/>
* Goron Spice made an accidental appearance in the novel ''A Traveler at the Gates of Wisdom'' by {{Wp|John Boyne}} due to the top Google search result for dyeing red clothes linking to the {{BotW|-}} recipe.<ref name="TheVerge.com"/>

